! Rigid TIP4P on NEWTIP, the GMIN angle-axis potential whose
! constants match GminTip4p. STEPS is long so H2H_BUDGET is the stop.
! The driver appends one RANSEED line per run.
! CENTRE and SORT are omitted: they reorder a centre/angle-axis block.

NTIP 4
SLOPPYCONV 1.0D-3
TIGHTCONV 1.0D-4
EDIFF 0.01
MAXIT 800 500
SAVE 2

TEMPERATURE 2.0
FIXTEMP
STEPS 90000000 1.0
STEP 0.40 0.51
FIXSTEP
